{"n":70,"name":"Al-Ma'arij","nameAr":"المعارج","meaning":"The Ascending Stairways","ayahs":44,"place":"makkah","bismillah":true,"ayat":[{"n":1,"juz":29,"ar":"سَأَلَ سَآئِلٌۢ بِعَذَابٍ وَاقِعٍ","en":"A supplicant asked for a punishment bound to happen","w":[{"ar":"سَأَلَ","tr":"sa-ala","en":"Asked","root":"سأل","lem":"سَأَلَ"},{"ar":"سَآئِلٌۢ","tr":"sāilun","en":"a questioner","root":"سأل","lem":"سائِل"},{"ar":"بِعَذَابٍۢ","tr":"biʿadhābin","en":"about a punishment","root":"عذب","lem":"عَذاب"},{"ar":"وَاقِعٍۢ","tr":"wāqiʿin","en":"bound to happen","root":"وقع","lem":"واقِع"}]},{"n":2,"juz":29,"ar":"لِّلْكَـٰفِرِينَ لَيْسَ لَهُۥ دَافِعٌ","en":"To the disbelievers; of it there is no preventer.","w":[{"ar":"لِّلْكَـٰفِرِينَ","tr":"lil'kāfirīna","en":"To the disbelievers","root":"كفر","lem":"كافِر"},{"ar":"لَيْسَ","tr":"laysa","en":"not","root":"ليس","lem":"لَيْسَ"},{"ar":"لَهُۥ","tr":"lahu","en":"of it"},{"ar":"دَافِعٌۭ","tr":"dāfiʿun","en":"any preventer","root":"دفع","lem":"دافِع"}]},{"n":3,"juz":29,"ar":"مِّنَ ٱللَّهِ ذِى ٱلْمَعَارِجِ","en":"[It is] from Allāh, owner of the ways of ascent.","w":[{"ar":"مِّنَ","tr":"mina","en":"From"},{"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","tr":"l-lahi","en":"Allah","root":"أله","lem":"اللَّه"},{"ar":"ذِى","tr":"dhī","en":"Owner"},{"ar":"ٱلْمَعَارِجِ","tr":"l-maʿāriji","en":"(of) the ways of ascent","root":"عرج","lem":"مَعارِج"}]},{"n":4,"juz":29,"ar":"تَعْرُجُ ٱلْمَلَـٰٓئِكَةُ وَٱلرُّوحُ إِلَيْهِ فِى يَوْمٍ كَانَ مِقْدَارُهُۥ خَمْسِينَ أَلْفَ سَنَةٍ","en":"The angels and the Spirit [i.e., Gabriel] will ascend to Him during a Day the extent of which is fifty thousand years.","w":[{"ar":"تَعْرُجُ","tr":"taʿruju","en":"Ascend","root":"عرج","lem":"يَعْرُجُ"},{"ar":"ٱلْمَلَـٰٓئِكَةُ","tr":"l-malāikatu","en":"the Angels","root":"ملك","lem":"مَلَك"},{"ar":"وَٱلرُّوحُ","tr":"wal-rūḥu","en":"and the Spirit","root":"روح","lem":"رُوح"},{"ar":"إِلَيْهِ","tr":"ilayhi","en":"to Him"},{"ar":"فِى","tr":"fī","en":"in"},{"ar":"يَوْمٍۢ","tr":"yawmin","en":"a Day","root":"يو