 who guard their private parts","w":[{"ar":"وَٱلَّذِينَ","tr":"wa-alladhīna","en":"And those who"},{"ar":"هُمْ","tr":"hum","en":"[they]"},{"ar":"لِفُرُوجِهِمْ","tr":"lifurūjihim","en":"their modesty","root":"فرج","lem":"فَرْج"},{"ar":"حَـٰفِظُونَ","tr":"ḥāfiẓūna","en":"(are) guardians","root":"حفظ","lem":"حافِظ"}]},{"n":30,"juz":29,"ar":"إِلَّا عَلَىٰٓ أَزْوَٰجِهِمْ أَوْ مَا مَلَكَتْ أَيْمَـٰنُهُمْ فَإِنَّهُمْ غَيْرُ مَلُومِينَ","en":"Except from their wives or those their right hands possess, for indeed, they are not to be blamed -","w":[{"ar":"إِلَّا","tr":"illā","en":"Except"},{"ar":"عَلَىٰٓ","tr":"ʿalā","en":"from"},{"ar":"أَزْوَٰجِهِمْ","tr":"azwājihim","en":"their spouses","root":"زوج","lem":"زَوْج"},{"ar":"أَوْ","tr":"aw","en":"or"},{"ar":"مَا","tr":"mā","en":"what"},{"ar":"مَلَكَتْ","tr":"malakat","en":"they possess","root":"ملك","lem":"مَلَكَتْ"},{"ar":"أَيْمَـٰنُهُمْ","tr":"aymānuhum","en":"rightfully","root":"يمن","lem":"يَمِين"},{"ar":"فَإِنَّهُمْ","tr":"fa-innahum","en":"then indeed, they"},{"ar":"غَيْرُ","tr":"ghayru","en":"(are) not","root":"غير","lem":"غَيْر"},{"ar":"مَلُومِينَ","tr":"malūmīna","en":"blameworthy","root":"لوم","lem":"مَلُوم"}]},{"n":31,"juz":29,"ar":"فَمَنِ ٱبْتَغَىٰ وَرَآءَ ذَٰلِكَ فَأُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ هُمُ ٱلْعَادُونَ","en":"But whoever seeks beyond that, then they are the transgressors -","w":[{"ar":"فَمَنِ","tr":"famani","en":"But whoever"},{"ar":"ٱبْتَغَىٰ","tr":"ib'taghā","en":"seeks","root":"بغي","lem":"ابْتَغَى"},{"ar":"وَرَآءَ","tr":"warāa","en":"beyond","root":"وري","lem":"وَراء"},{"ar":"ذَٰلِكَ","tr":"dhālika","en":"that"},{"ar":"فَأُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","tr":"fa-ulāika","en":"then those"},{"ar":"هُمُ","tr":"humu","en":"[they]"},{"ar":"ٱلْعَادُونَ","tr":"l-ʿādūna","en":"(are) the transgressors ","root":"عدو","lem":"عاد"}]},{"n":32,"juz":29,"ar":"وَٱلَّذِينَ هُمْ لِأَمَـٰنَـٰتِهِمْ وَعَهْدِهِمْ رَٰعُونَ","en":"And those who are to their trusts and promises attentive.","w":[{"ar":"وَٱلَّذِينَ","tr":"wa-alladhīna","en":"And those who"},{